Dear all,

I meet a strange problem with winbugs and openbugs used withoin MCMCsuite: it seems they have no burnin phase with the following commnd althrough burnin is greater than 0:

modelN.shorter=MCMCsuite(code = modelCode,  constants = ModelConsts, inits = inits1, data = ModelData,
                thin = 10, monitors = parameters, niter=50000, burnin=1000,
                calculateEfficiency = TRUE, MCMCs = c("winbugs","openbugs","jags","nimble","nimble_slice"),
                makePlot=FALSE,savePlot=FALSE,
                debug=FALSE
                )

Is there a coding issue inside MCMCsuite for burnin specification for Winbugs & Openbugs?

I think I sue the latest version of Nimble (but where to find it?), under R3.3.0.

Sincerely,

Frédéric Gosselin

